dim.js: FCPMDim.wake(), a touch from elsewhere

For #178: kiosk-1's door reads Windows' last input so a mouse on one panel
wakes both. It calls FCPMDim.wake() instead of dispatching a synthetic keydown.

- [x] FCPMDim.wake(): the hour restarts and the screen wakes; nothing swallowed
- [x] checked in Edge on a dim wall: dim -> wake() -> awake, and stays awake
